    "body": "## Parent\n\n#172\n\n## What to build\n\nDeliver recoverable Trash, restoration with prior status intact, explicitly confirmed permanent deletion, and Task survival when a source Meeting, Meeting Debrief, Transcript, or generated artifact is removed.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Trashing an unlinked Task removes it from ordinary open/completed results and preserves it in Trash.\n- [ ] Restoring a Task returns it with its prior open or completed state intact.\n- [ ] Permanent deletion is available only from Trash and requires explicit confirmation.\n- [ ] A Task survives deletion of its source Meeting, Meeting Debrief, Transcript, or generated artifact.\n- [ ] Unavailable sources are reported honestly instead of deleting or corrupting the Task.\n- [ ] Interrupted or invalid file writes preserve the previous valid Task store.\n- [ ] `npm run check` is green.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #173 — Capture and complete a manual Inbox Task\n- #174 — Edit Task details and organize Task Lists",
